# text = Is there nobody here who can sing a song to lighten the time Perhaps the lady would not object Some little Italian thing out of the last opera brought out in town , would be most acceptable I am sure I would if I could for I hold that in this , as in all other cases where people who are strangers to each other are thrown unexpectedly together , they should endeavour to render themselves as pleasant , for the joint sake of the little community , as possible I wish the maxim were more generally acted on , in all cases I'm glad to hear it Perhaps , as you can't sing , you'll tell us a story Nay .
