# text = An absence of business habits in this family leads , apparently , to a great waste of words before business -- when it does come under consideration -- is arrived at , at all I fear it is so indeed Your poor brother My poor brother , ma'am had no idea what business was -- was unacquainted , I verily believe , with the very meaning of the word I fear he was If it hadn't been for me , I don't know what would have become of him Repining is of no use , ma'am
