# text = I have not one thought , wish , or hope , connected with her , unless it be -- and I say this , not to hurt her feelings , but to impress her with the real state of my own -- unless it be the one object , dear to my heart as life itself , of being one day able to turn my back upon this accursed place , never to set foot in it again , or think of it -- even think of it -- but with loathing and disgust Let him see if I don't set mother against him a little more when she comes back I can't do it No , no Do not try Do not for God's sake I cannot bear to see you They are more hard with me than ever I know it They are But for you I should die .
