# text = The fact is , that he did find so much in the books he read , applicable to his own misfortunes , and did find himself in every respect so much like the heroes -- because of course he is conscious of his own superiority , as we all are , and very naturally -- that he took to scorning everything , and became a genius ; and I am quite sure that he is , at this very present moment , writing another book Another book Yes another book , in three volumes post octavo .
