# text = Is there anything good for me Let me see You play the faithful and attached servant ; you are turned out of doors with the wife and child Always coupled with that infernal phenomenon and we go into poor lodgings , where I won't take any wages , and talk sentiment , I suppose Why -- yes that is the course of the piece I must have a dance of some kind , you know You'll have to introduce one for the phenomenon , so you'd better make a PAS DE DEUX , and save time There's nothing easier than that Upon my word I don't see how it's to be done Why , isn't it obvious Gadzooks , who can help seeing the way to do it ?-- you astonish me !
