# text = I find , running through the performances of this child a unity of feeling , a breadth , a light and shade , a warmth of colouring , a tone , a harmony , a glow , an artistical development of original conceptions , which I look for , in vain , among older performers -- I don't know whether I make myself understood Perfectly Just so That is my definition of the unities of the drama I don't know , my dear ; upon my word I don't know If we do , it must be distinctly understood that we do not pledge ourselves to the quality of the performances .
