# text = If a bachelor happens to have saved a little matter of money his sisters and brothers , and nephews and nieces , look TO that money , and not to him ; even if , by being a public character , he is the head of the family , or , as it may be , the main from which all the other little branches are turned on , they still wish him dead all the while , and get low-spirited every time they see him looking in good health , because they want to come into his little property .
