# text = I am sure there was a case in the day before yesterday's paper , extracted from one of the French newspapers , about a journeyman shoemaker who was jealous of a young girl in an adjoining village , because she wouldn't shut herself up in an air - tight three-pair-of-stairs , and charcoal herself to death with him ; and who went and hid himself in a wood with a sharp-pointed knife , and rushed out , as she was passing by with a few friends , and killed himself first , and then all the friends , and then her -- no , killed all the friends first , and then herself , and then HIMself -- which it is quite frightful to think of .
