# text = Shot beyond him , I mean in quite another respect , for , whereas he brought within the magic circle of his genius , traditions peculiarly adapted for his purpose , and turned familiar things into constellations which should enlighten the world for ages , you drag within the magic circle of your dulness , subjects not at all adapted to the purposes of the stage , and debase as he exalted .
