# text = Now , show me the distinction between such pilfering as this , and picking a man's pocket in the street : unless , indeed , it be , that the legislature has a regard for pocket-handkerchiefs , and leaves men's brains , except when they are knocked out by violence , to take care of themselves Men must live , sir That would be an equally fair plea in both cases but if you put it upon that ground , I have nothing more to say , than , that if I were a writer of books , and you a thirsty dramatist , I would rather pay your tavern score for six months , large as it might be , than have a niche in the Temple of Fame with you for the humblest corner of my pedestal , through six hundred generations Now , Tim All charged , sir , and waiting for a toast
