# text = This fellow -- I grieve to say my brother's son : a reprobate and profligate , stained with every mean and selfish crime -- this fellow , coming here today to disturb a solemn ceremony , and knowing that the consequence of his presenting himself in another man's house at such a time , and persisting in remaining there , must be his being kicked into the streets and dragged through them like the vagabond he is -- this fellow , mark you , brings with him his sister as a protection , thinking we would not expose a silly girl to the degradation and indignity which is no novelty to him ; and , even after I have warned her of what must ensue , he still keeps her by him , as you see , and clings to her apron-strings like a cowardly boy to his mother's .
