# text = Upon that point I shall express no opinion , it wouldn't become me to do so , it's quite out of the question , quite I think it my duty , Nicholas , my dear to tell you what I know : not only because you have a right to know it too , and to know everything that happens in this family , but because you have it in your power to promote and assist the thing very much ; and there is no doubt that the sooner one can come to a clear understanding on such subjects , it is always better , every way .
