# text = These seem very slight things , and I dare say you will be amused at my making them of so much importance ; at the same time , my dear , I can assure you ( and you'll find this out , Nicholas , for yourself one of these days , if you ever fall in love with anybody ; as I trust and hope you will , provided she is respectable and well conducted , and of course you'd never dream of falling in love with anybody who was not ), I say , I can assure you that a great deal more depends upon these little things than you would suppose possible .
