# text = My reparation comes too late ; and , neither in this world nor in the next , can I have hope again I am sure I have lost the best , the most zealous , and most attentive creature that has ever been a companion to me in my life -- putting you , my dear Nicholas , and Kate , and your poor papa , and that well-behaved nurse who ran away with the linen and the twelve small forks , out of the question , of course .
