# text = Sometimes , I try to think that the time may come when I may honestly tell her this ; but it is so far off ; in such distant perspective , so many years must elapse before it comes , and when it does come ( if ever ) I shall be so unlike what I am now , and shall have so outlived my days of youth and romance -- though not , I am sure , of love for her -- that even I feel how visionary all such hopes must be , and try to crush them rudely myself , and have the pain over , rather than suffer time to wither them , and keep the disappointment in store .
