# text = How base would it be of me to take advantage of the circumstances which placed her here , or of the slight service I was happily able to render her , and to seek to engage her affections when the result must be , if I succeeded , that the brothers would be disappointed in their darling wish of establishing her as their own child , and that I must seem to hope to build my fortunes on their compassion for the young creature whom I had so meanly and unworthily entrapped : turning her very gratitude and warmth of heart to my own purpose and account , and trading in her misfortunes !
